## Definitions

“Company Product” means a product owned, controlled, or operated by Haokir Inc. or an entity controlled by Haokir Inc. This includes products in Haokir Inc.’s portfolio, including Hydite, Zorker, Zorker Openlink, and Cauiril, as well as future Haokir products.

“Authorized Product” means a Company Product or another product that Haokir Inc. expressly authorizes in a written notice or agreement.

