Use of the SDK in any other product requires Haokir Inc.’s written authorization. You may not sell, sublicense, publish, or otherwise make the SDK available separately from an Authorized Product. All rights not expressly granted here are reserved by Haokir Inc. or the applicable third-party licensor.

